WEBVTT

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.125
How dare you...?!

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:21.625
Amata!

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:22.792
Stop it, Andy!

00:00:22.792 --> 00:00:25.000
Let go of me, you jerk!

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.708
Why... Why didn't you save Mix?!

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.417
You shouldn't talk like that!

00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:34.750
She's right! Amata was trying
to protect Zessica and...

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.250
Zessica!

00:00:40.542 --> 00:00:45.417
If you have time to fight your friend,
think about saving Mix!

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:47.250
Save her?!

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.667
If I could, I would've done that already!

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:54.792
But...

00:00:54.792 --> 00:00:57.708
The dimensional gate remains shut.

00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:01.208
Not even the slightest bending
of space-time can be seen.

00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:03.417
Then what about rescuing Mix?!

00:01:03.417 --> 00:01:04.667
Dammit!

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:08.042
Where the hell did the Supreme
Commander go at a time like this?!

00:01:08.042 --> 00:01:09.917
He can see...

00:01:09.917 --> 00:01:11.000
What?

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.208
...the fate the two planets follow...

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:20.125
...and the whereabouts of the
seed of destiny that can sway it.

00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:26.125
Ants...

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:29.458
Appar-ant-ly, ants will be ants.

00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:33.958
<i>You're so beautiful it's depressing</i>

00:01:33.958 --> 00:01:42.000
<i>Let's love each other platonically</i>
<i>in this topsy-turvy world</i>

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:58.667
<i>The world we're looking at</i>
<i>is always upside down</i>

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:07.625
<i>We don't have control</i>
<i>over how things get decided</i>

00:02:07.625 --> 00:02:13.250
<i>You're so hurt that your eyes are in tears</i>

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:19.500
<i>I stayed silent while my heart cried out</i>

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:31.583
<i>While the last two were kept apart,</i>
<i>the countdown has started</i>

00:02:31.583 --> 00:02:36.250
<i>You're so beautiful it's depressing</i>

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:42.125
<i>Let's love each other like animals</i>
<i>on the verge of extinction</i>

00:02:42.125 --> 00:02:46.625
<i>You're so beautiful it makes me wanna cry</i>

00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:52.708
<i>I want to feel a platonic love</i>
<i>in this topsy-turvy world</i>

00:03:00.667 --> 00:03:05.458
"First Reunion"

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:08.000
Mix...

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.958
There's no way I can let things end like this.

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:16.750
I... I still haven't held you in my arms...

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.083
...not to mention your big bang...!

00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:25.500
Dammit! I'm so low,
thinking of that at a time like this!

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.083
Damn you, Andy! What's with you?!

00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:31.583
I should die! Dammit! Dammit! Dammit!

00:03:36.333 --> 00:03:39.042
Andy! Did you eat them?

00:03:44.583 --> 00:03:47.458
He sent the ones from last night, too.

00:03:49.542 --> 00:03:52.083
I wonder if there's something I can do.

00:03:52.083 --> 00:03:54.167
Yunoha...

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:56.833
The pain of losing someone dear to you...

00:03:56.833 --> 00:03:59.458
I don't want him to experience that.

00:04:01.458 --> 00:04:03.125
Say, Yunoha...

00:04:04.417 --> 00:04:06.708
Would you let me handle this?

00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:15.458
It's been a week now.

00:04:15.458 --> 00:04:17.708
I hope Mix is okay.

00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:21.083
Where's Zessica?

00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:23.208
She said she'd be absent again today.

00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:25.833
She's been moping.

00:04:34.792 --> 00:04:39.625
How sad... I'm as pathetic as they come.

00:04:40.792 --> 00:04:44.792
Why did you save me, Amata?

00:04:46.417 --> 00:04:49.667
If you're not going to choose me...

00:04:49.667 --> 00:04:52.833
...staying here only makes me feel miserable.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:00.625
The same image from that time...!

00:05:03.333 --> 00:05:05.125
Don't be afraid.

00:05:05.125 --> 00:05:06.500
Can't be...!

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:08.042
Oh, no...!

00:05:09.667 --> 00:05:11.500
Don't cry.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:20.792
We're the same. We both have been rejected.

00:05:20.792 --> 00:05:23.583
Wh-What're you talking about?

00:05:24.875 --> 00:05:28.167
Since you've been rejected...

00:05:28.167 --> 00:05:31.917
...you know that even if you cling to the
hand that is capriciously held out to you,

00:05:31.917 --> 00:05:35.542
your hand will be shaken off easily.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:44.292
I can tear off the hand held
out to you and give it to you.

00:05:45.458 --> 00:05:48.542
I'll grant your wish.

00:05:48.542 --> 00:05:52.250
I'll open the dimensional gate for you.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:57.125
In return, I want you to promise me something.

00:06:20.542 --> 00:06:22.083
Mikono!

00:06:22.083 --> 00:06:25.583
You're going to go look for the Supreme
Commander all by yourself? Why?!

00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:30.417
I don't know... but he told me...

00:06:31.417 --> 00:06:37.583
Your power connects those
separated people once again.

00:06:37.583 --> 00:06:38.917
That's right...

00:06:38.917 --> 00:06:44.083
Your power connects the separated souls.

00:06:45.458 --> 00:06:51.750
You said that we should put our
hearts together right now, right?

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:56.583
I think it's my duty to connect
everyone's feelings. So...

00:06:56.583 --> 00:06:59.417
What?! But they're two different things!

00:06:59.417 --> 00:07:01.708
They might be two different things.

00:07:01.708 --> 00:07:03.292
I know that.

00:07:03.292 --> 00:07:04.792
But...

00:07:04.792 --> 00:07:08.292
I don't wanna say I'm incapable and lose Mix!

00:07:08.292 --> 00:07:09.750
Then, I'll come with you!

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:13.500
What if Altair launches an attack now?

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:17.292
Unlike everyone else, I don't have
an Element power that is for fighting.

00:07:17.292 --> 00:07:18.375
So...

00:07:18.375 --> 00:07:20.417
But...!

00:07:20.417 --> 00:07:25.208
There's something I want to say to you...

00:07:25.208 --> 00:07:27.125
All this time...

00:07:27.125 --> 00:07:29.792
...I couldn't say it because I was too afraid.

00:07:29.792 --> 00:07:31.583
But when I return...

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.000
...I'll definitely say it to you.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.250
Wait! Mikono!

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.833
You really are harsh on Amata,
aren't you, Shushu?

00:07:54.042 --> 00:07:59.333
To think that Shushu took to this
Kagura guy, but she hisses at us...

00:07:59.333 --> 00:08:03.167
I wonder if she hates Amata and me.

00:08:03.167 --> 00:08:06.292
I don't think that's what it is.

00:08:06.292 --> 00:08:09.792
I think she's jealous of you two. Right, Shushu?

00:08:09.792 --> 00:08:15.625
She's always been like this.
She hisses at those I'm close to.

00:08:15.625 --> 00:08:19.625
Does that mean... you really
do have feelings for Amata?

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:29.458
I didn't want to get hurt.

00:08:29.458 --> 00:08:34.042
Because of that, I hurt both Amata and Zessica.

00:08:34.042 --> 00:08:36.500
I have to tell him.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:40.208
I'll connect everyone and rescue Mix!

00:08:40.208 --> 00:08:42.083
Then, I will...

00:08:50.083 --> 00:08:52.708
The dimensional gate has
appeared right above the academy!

00:08:52.708 --> 00:08:54.125
What?!

00:08:54.125 --> 00:08:56.792
Our enemies are gonna show their faces again?!

00:08:56.792 --> 00:08:58.708
Th-That's...!

00:09:06.292 --> 00:09:08.208
--This is strange!
--What's the matter?!

00:09:08.208 --> 00:09:10.375
The radar isn't detecting any enemy machines!

00:09:10.375 --> 00:09:11.500
What?!

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.958
That's the gate, right?!

00:09:12.958 --> 00:09:14.292
Andy!

00:09:14.292 --> 00:09:18.542
We can go to Altair!
We can go and get Mix back, right?!

00:09:18.542 --> 00:09:21.208
Don't be hasty! This could be the enemy's trap!

00:09:21.208 --> 00:09:22.417
Trap?

00:09:22.417 --> 00:09:28.917
Mr. Donar is right. I can't help thinking
that they're trying to lure us there.

00:09:29.958 --> 00:09:33.583
I'll grant your wish.

00:09:36.917 --> 00:09:38.833
Zessica?

00:09:38.833 --> 00:09:40.750
The Supreme Commander is currently absent.

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:45.917
We cannot send Aquarion, our most
powerful weapon, to Altair now!

00:09:45.917 --> 00:09:49.208
Then, are you saying you don't
care what happens to Mix?!

00:09:49.208 --> 00:09:52.833
I do understand how you're feeling, Andy, but...

00:09:52.833 --> 00:09:57.333
To think that we're stuck here,
not being able to do anything...

00:09:57.333 --> 00:09:59.583
Excuse me.

00:09:59.583 --> 00:10:02.625
Commander! I mean, Headmaster!

00:10:02.625 --> 00:10:04.792
Director Crea, this is for you.

00:10:04.792 --> 00:10:07.208
Supreme Commander Fudo
asked me to give it to you.

00:10:07.208 --> 00:10:08.708
What?!

00:10:10.917 --> 00:10:12.083
Donuts...?

00:10:12.083 --> 00:10:15.208
Ahhh! There are ants!

00:10:15.208 --> 00:10:17.292
Hm? What's going on?

00:10:19.583 --> 00:10:21.083
They disappeared!

00:10:21.083 --> 00:10:22.583
No...

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:30.375
This is a message from Fudo.

00:10:30.375 --> 00:10:31.708
What?

00:10:31.708 --> 00:10:34.167
Don't be afraid. Jump into the ring.

00:10:34.167 --> 00:10:35.667
Into the ring?

00:10:35.667 --> 00:10:40.333
Otherwise, you can't bring back the candy.

00:10:40.333 --> 00:10:42.042
Candy...?

00:10:43.292 --> 00:10:44.792
That's Mix!

00:10:45.875 --> 00:10:47.875
This is the order from the Supreme Commander!

00:10:49.125 --> 00:10:52.000
Deploy Aquarion immediately!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.625
Roger!

00:10:53.625 --> 00:10:57.042
I did it. I did it.

00:10:57.042 --> 00:11:02.292
I opened the gate to grant your wish.

00:11:02.292 --> 00:11:05.042
You, the one with bright green hair...

00:11:05.042 --> 00:11:08.917
I'll eventually have you keep your promise.

00:11:10.042 --> 00:11:15.958
And now, it's your turn, Kagura.

00:11:18.708 --> 00:11:22.125
Vector Y, condition, all green!

00:11:22.125 --> 00:11:23.875
Ready to take off!

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.708
I'm sorry.

00:11:28.708 --> 00:11:32.167
I'll be taking this seat, my good friend.

00:11:35.875 --> 00:11:37.958
--Cayenne!
--What?!

00:11:37.958 --> 00:11:39.917
Then, who's in the Vector machine?!

00:11:39.917 --> 00:11:42.667
This is Shrade Elan. I'm taking off!

00:11:44.042 --> 00:11:45.583
Shrade!

00:11:45.583 --> 00:11:49.458
In order to seek out an unknown
tone in an unknown world...

00:11:49.458 --> 00:11:53.458
In order to complete the
last melody I will play...!

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:57.583
I can't take part in a Gattai
among both genders yet.

00:11:57.583 --> 00:11:59.042
No, I won't do it!

00:11:59.042 --> 00:12:01.500
My first Gattai...

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:04.458
...will be dedicated to you, Mix!

00:12:07.083 --> 00:12:12.333
Sennyuu Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:12:17.125 --> 00:12:19.583
Aquarion Evol!

00:12:31.292 --> 00:12:32.958
About that soldier...

00:12:32.958 --> 00:12:36.792
It seems that it'll take a while for his
thoughts to be completely stabilized.

00:12:36.792 --> 00:12:40.542
However, he's already cleared the last phase.

00:12:40.542 --> 00:12:43.792
His ability as a pilot is exceptional.

00:12:43.792 --> 00:12:46.667
This isn't the result I hoped for,

00:12:46.667 --> 00:12:51.375
but does this mean that he's useful
as a fighter now that Jin's gone?

00:12:51.375 --> 00:12:54.250
Sir Izumo! The dimensional
gate has been activated!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:58.167
What?! Is this Mykage's doing again?!

00:12:58.167 --> 00:13:02.708
When opening the dimensional route,
a massive amount of energy is consumed.

00:13:02.708 --> 00:13:08.000
Each time the gate is activated,
it reduces the power remaining in Altair!

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:10.625
Even knowing that, he still
has the nerve to do it!

00:13:15.875 --> 00:13:18.667
We detected that something
passed through? Is it invaders?!

00:13:18.667 --> 00:13:21.500
Well... there are no traces of that!

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:23.875
We are detecting neither mass nor heat!

00:13:23.875 --> 00:13:25.500
What?!

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.500
Did the gate malfunction?

00:13:36.667 --> 00:13:38.792
Yunoha! Hang in there a bit longer!

00:13:38.792 --> 00:13:40.708
Y-Yes.

00:13:40.708 --> 00:13:42.583
So this is Altair.

00:13:42.583 --> 00:13:47.542
What's with this planet?
The surface is covered by iron plates?

00:13:47.542 --> 00:13:49.708
Looks like we can break in through there.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:58.625
Tombs...?

00:13:58.625 --> 00:14:00.292
There are so many...

00:14:15.708 --> 00:14:17.375
--Yunoha!
--Are you okay?

00:14:17.375 --> 00:14:23.917
Yes. But this transparency
only lasts half a day at most.

00:14:23.917 --> 00:14:27.083
We have to find Mix quickly.

00:14:27.083 --> 00:14:29.417
The tone of this planet...

00:14:29.417 --> 00:14:33.500
It sounds like the hoarse
sorrow of an old woman.

00:14:39.792 --> 00:14:43.042
Hey, Andy! You're going too fast!

00:14:43.042 --> 00:14:47.083
Just wait, Mix! I'm gonna rescue you for sure!

00:14:47.083 --> 00:14:50.458
Yunoha, it might've been better for you
to wait in one of the Vector machines.

00:14:50.458 --> 00:14:53.042
No. I want to go.

00:14:53.042 --> 00:14:57.167
I want to see the planet
Jin was born on with Tama.

00:15:07.542 --> 00:15:11.417
Alicia...! It's "Skies of Aquaria"!

00:15:11.417 --> 00:15:14.917
Why is a movie from Earth
being shown on Altair?

00:15:14.917 --> 00:15:17.125
It's not surprising.

00:15:17.125 --> 00:15:22.042
Alicia's image was recorded on
this device of Jin's, too, so...

00:15:22.042 --> 00:15:26.083
Mom... Did you come to this world after all...?

00:15:29.083 --> 00:15:32.875
Huh? Isn't that Alicia's visual data?

00:15:32.875 --> 00:15:35.167
Now that's rare.

00:15:36.375 --> 00:15:41.125
Hm? What's with you guys?
You're wearing weird clothes.

00:15:41.125 --> 00:15:42.792
Yunoha, step back!

00:15:42.792 --> 00:15:46.500
You guys look like Iguras.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.833
Are those bumps fake?

00:15:50.833 --> 00:15:52.333
You bastard!

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.042
Zessica!

00:15:55.042 --> 00:15:56.750
I can't believe it!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:59.917
Element suits stand out too much.

00:15:59.917 --> 00:16:02.833
We need to get ourselves a change of clothes.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.167
They stink!

00:16:15.167 --> 00:16:17.833
Bear it, Andy.

00:16:17.833 --> 00:16:22.125
More importantly, I've been
noticing that something is weird.

00:16:26.333 --> 00:16:30.458
Apparently, there are only men in this town.

00:16:30.458 --> 00:16:33.625
No, possibly even the entire world.

00:16:33.625 --> 00:16:37.458
Hey! Could the reason they abduct women be...

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:41.708
Are you okay?

00:16:41.708 --> 00:16:46.042
My throat has been bothering me
since we arrived in this world.

00:16:46.042 --> 00:16:48.333
Now that you mention it, me too.

00:16:48.333 --> 00:16:50.583
I wonder if the air is dirty.

00:16:50.583 --> 00:16:53.083
I feel that might be the case, but...

00:16:55.042 --> 00:16:56.208
That's the...

00:16:56.208 --> 00:17:00.542
It seems like there's no mistake.
According to the information Jin left...

00:17:00.542 --> 00:17:03.000
That's our enemy's headquarters, huh?

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.375
What should we do?

00:17:04.375 --> 00:17:08.167
There's no guarantee that
Mix will be there, but...

00:17:08.167 --> 00:17:10.375
We just have to go and check!

00:17:10.375 --> 00:17:11.875
Yeah!

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:20.667
Incredible...

00:17:20.667 --> 00:17:24.000
Andy's ability to open a hole
is more powerful than before.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:26.250
Hey! Wait up, Andy!

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:28.708
Infiltrators have been
detected in the hangar block!

00:17:28.708 --> 00:17:31.792
All soldiers, take up Class I Battle Positions!

00:17:31.792 --> 00:17:35.542
We also have information that
they're infiltrators from Vega.

00:17:35.542 --> 00:17:39.417
So keep in mind that Gnises
could be deployed as well!

00:17:39.417 --> 00:17:42.542
Look. Simulations and
actual battles are different.

00:17:42.542 --> 00:17:45.083
So be on your guard, got that?!

00:17:45.083 --> 00:17:46.625
Don't move!

00:17:50.208 --> 00:17:52.333
I said don't move!

00:17:53.458 --> 00:17:55.250
A hole?!

00:17:55.250 --> 00:18:00.542
You'd better be careful!
There's no telling what I might do!

00:18:00.542 --> 00:18:03.667
Now, we'll have you take us
through this building.

00:18:03.667 --> 00:18:08.750
Do what we tell you. Or you'll
have a huge hole in your guts.

00:18:14.125 --> 00:18:15.625
I found them!

00:18:16.625 --> 00:18:18.208
Dammit!

00:18:23.667 --> 00:18:27.125
Andy, Amata! We'll hold them back here!

00:18:27.125 --> 00:18:28.917
You two go and find Mix!

00:18:28.917 --> 00:18:30.625
Be careful, Amata.

00:18:30.625 --> 00:18:33.500
Promise me that you won't do
anything reckless, no matter what!

00:18:34.667 --> 00:18:36.375
Thanks, guys!

00:18:37.583 --> 00:18:39.125
Amata...

00:18:43.417 --> 00:18:46.667
What a crude and inelegant dissonance...

00:18:46.667 --> 00:18:50.042
I'm not going to let you
hinder the melody of love!

00:19:03.167 --> 00:19:04.667
Super Twister!

00:19:12.292 --> 00:19:14.917
--Looks like they're gone.
--Okay, stand up!

00:19:16.375 --> 00:19:18.500
The wound from earlier...

00:19:28.958 --> 00:19:31.000
--Did you find them?!
--No good!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:33.833
Dammit! You go search Area 83!

00:19:33.833 --> 00:19:35.208
Roger that!

00:19:35.208 --> 00:19:37.375
Andy, now's our chance!

00:19:40.792 --> 00:19:42.333
Don't move.

00:19:43.708 --> 00:19:46.167
Why did you treat my wound?

00:19:46.167 --> 00:19:48.125
Don't talk.

00:19:48.125 --> 00:19:51.792
We can't have them finding us because
you're bleeding all over the place.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.750
Now!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.042
Dead end?!

00:20:08.042 --> 00:20:12.083
This is the only elevator that goes
to the top floors of this tower.

00:20:12.083 --> 00:20:14.167
Unlock it!

00:20:14.167 --> 00:20:17.083
Please! We want to rescue our friend!

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:23.667
In order to rescue that friend,
I'll do anything, no matter how cruel it is!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.167
Hey! Hurry up!

00:20:44.958 --> 00:20:46.167
You bastard!

00:20:46.167 --> 00:20:48.292
--I came to realize...
--What?

00:20:48.292 --> 00:20:50.708
...that no matter what you say...

00:20:50.708 --> 00:20:53.333
...you can't kill me.

00:21:05.875 --> 00:21:07.875
--Amata! Get out of here!
--But...!

00:21:07.875 --> 00:21:11.792
If both of us get caught,
who's gonna rescue Mix?!

00:21:13.292 --> 00:21:14.875
Mix...

00:21:14.875 --> 00:21:18.792
I'll be fine! I'm Andy the immortal!
Have faith in me!

00:21:19.917 --> 00:21:21.500
Go!

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:23.042
Andy...

00:21:28.208 --> 00:21:29.792
Wh-What?!

00:21:35.542 --> 00:21:39.250
An infiltrator who appears to be a
Vegan has reached the top floors!

00:21:40.292 --> 00:21:42.208
The winged boy!

00:21:50.625 --> 00:21:52.750
"Skies of Aquaria"?!

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:08.792
That's...

00:22:22.542 --> 00:22:24.292
Mom...

00:22:25.875 --> 00:22:29.000
Let go of me, you bastards! Dammit!

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:32.542
Give Mix back to me!

00:22:35.333 --> 00:22:36.917
Mix...

00:22:59.292 --> 00:23:07.208
<i>I saw a white flower on a slope</i>
<i>on my way towards you</i>

00:23:07.208 --> 00:23:14.833
<i>Even after awaking from my dream,</i>
<i>I gazed at a sad sky</i>

00:23:19.417 --> 00:23:25.208
<i>This feeling lives on a leaf's back</i>

00:23:26.833 --> 00:23:34.667
<i>I listen closely to the sound </i>
<i>of the falling morning dew</i>

00:23:34.667 --> 00:23:42.458
<i>God, the world you created is not perfect</i>

00:23:42.458 --> 00:23:50.250
<i>Here, every day many loves fall and die</i>

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:54.083
<i>This was my first time falling in love</i>

00:23:54.083 --> 00:23:57.375
<i>You don't even know it, do you...</i>

00:23:57.375 --> 00:24:01.833
<i>Even if you were on the other side of the earth,</i>

00:24:01.833 --> 00:24:05.042
<i>I wanted you to be by my side</i>

00:24:05.042 --> 00:24:09.542
<i>Even if you were going to forget about me,</i>

00:24:09.542 --> 00:24:15.625
<i>I wanted you to be by my side</i>

00:24:19.625 --> 00:24:22.917
Fill all my holes, Mix.

00:24:22.917 --> 00:24:25.833
The holes in my nose
that want your fragrance...

00:24:25.833 --> 00:24:28.375
The pores of my skin that
are tingling with anxiety...

00:24:30.625 --> 00:24:33.542
"Next Episode 'MI⋅XY'"
And... the large gaping hole in my heart...
